WEBVTT

00:13:28.614 --> 00:13:31.645
Lakini ni jinsi gani tutaelewa
nini katika jamii

00:13:31.669 --> 00:13:33.250
kinazalisha ukatili

00:13:33.274 --> 00:13:37.753
kama sisi kunataa kutambua
utu katika wale wanaoufanya?

00:13:38.534 --> 00:13:39.698

Na jinsi -

00:13:39.722 --> 00:13:41.901
(Makofi)

00:13:41.925 --> 00:13:47.293
Na tunawezaje kuwawezesha waliopitia taabu kama hatuwathamini?

00:13:48.072 --> 00:13:51.499
Jinsi gani tunaweza kujadili ufumbuzi
kwa moja ya vitisho kubwa

00:13:51.523 --> 00:13:54.797
katika maisha ya wanawake na watoto
duniani kote,

00:13:54.821 --> 00:13:58.644
kama majina tunayotumia
ni sehemu ya tatizo?